<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Hornacheros</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Hornacheros were <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/moriscos">Moriscos</a> from the town of Hornachos in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/extremadura">Extremadura</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/spain">Spain</a>, a community known for its cohesion and martial reputation. Expelled with the other Moriscos between 1609 and 1614, they settled in the kasbah of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rabat">Rabat</a> at the mouth of the Bou Regreg river in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/morocco">Morocco</a>. There they took a leading part in corsair raiding and in the self-governing Republic of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sale">Salé</a>.</p></div>
